# Decode the latest camera frame. The label ROI is used when a pose with the same stamp exists.
---
bool success
bool partial
# "" on success; no_image/no_camera_info/no_tag/busy/disabled/no_formats/decode_fail/partial/cancelled
string error
float32 elapsed_s
bool used_tag_roi
string report
Barcode[] codes
# Stamp/frame of the decoded image, same as ~result; empty when no frame was used (no_image/busy).
std_msgs/Header header
